## Baseline Contract

- Use the canonical cleaned dataset/corpus as the only baseline input.
- Record raw input path, cleaned input path, schema, version/hash, and row/document count.
- Persist split/fold manifests before training and reuse them for every model comparison.
- Fit preprocessing only inside train folds; never fit vectorizers/scalers/encoders on validation/test data.
- Treat test data/test queries as final reporting only; tune on train/CV/dev only.
{% if task_type in ["retrieval", "rag"] %}
- Record chunk ids, source ids, offsets, chunk size, overlap, and index config.
- Tune chunk size/overlap and top-k on dev queries only; report test once.
- Start with BM25. Add dense retrieval, hybrid retrieval, or reranking only as later controlled changes.
